Package: dex2c
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: android-sdk, android-ndk, android-cmake, openjdk-21, wget
Section: android
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Anon4You/dex2c
Description: Dalvik-to-C++ JNI compiler for Termux
 Compiles selected Java/Kotlin methods from an APK's Dalvik bytecode
 into C++ JNI functions and repacks the APK with a generated libdex2c.so.
 Single runnable jar with automatic SDK, NDK, and CMake discovery.
